          <li><a href="#marketplace" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">5. Marketplace role</a></li>
          <li><a href="#vendors" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">6. Vendor obligations</a></li>
          <li><a href="#buyers" class="toc-link block border-l-2 border-transparent pl-3 py-1.5 text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-900 transition">7. Buyer obligations</a></li>
